  "notes": "Owner decision 2026-11-24 (Inbox thread): the bank data has no location, so NO map panel. In its place in the one-by-one view: a merchant panel with legal name, CNPJ, business category, operation type and the other party on a PIX, shown when the bank sent them.\nCheckpoint 1 (commit bb6cb335af): eight categorize operations in the RTK Query slice + data/api.ts exports; /categorize route and rail item with whole-queue count (queue read limit 1, no count-only endpoint); pure tested queue/bundle view-model, keyboard map and optimistic accept/undo reducer; placeholder screen only. client tsc/eslint green, bun test 1348 pass.\nFinished web Categorize: One by one view (queue pane, focus pane, merchant panel, 1/2/3/Enter/S/Z keys ignored while typing, / focuses search, optimistic advance, progress counter, skip=server skip), short-date formatter (formatDateShort), one shared ActionToast in ui/primitives for transfers and Categorize, last accept stays undoable after toast timeout, bundle rows follow the re-read, bundle-changed message says the list is refreshed, header dims without AI. Verified in browser: accept bundle, undo, accept all + undo, per-row pick, 409 path, threshold set, keys 1/2/3/Enter/S/Z, / search, empty state buttons, freshness (register edit via API refreshes page+rail within the revision poll). Checks in client/: tsc 0, eslint 0, bun test 1403 pass 0 fail. Demo data: seeded connection_transactions raw_payload for Posto Ipiranga/PIX Mariana/Uber and rank 2-3 suggestions (Transport .86, Travel .81) for Posto Ipiranga in budgetnew_dev (Categorize demo).\nReview round 1 fixes: B1 (blur after pointer press, type-to-search for printable keys, skip deferred 10s with Undo/Z, skip copy 'Leave uncategorized' + hint; leaving the page CANCELS a pending skip), B2 (undo in 1000-id chunks, exact outcome, remainder stays undoable), follow-ups 1-10. client: tsc 0, eslint 0, bun test 1428 pass 0 fail.\nReview round 2 fixes: undo stack in press order, each skip 